cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this hardware, please cite the OpenMuscle technical report below (DOI pending)."
type: software
title: "OpenMuscle-FlexGrid"
abstract: >-
  Open hardware for the OpenMuscle FlexGrid, a 60-cell (15x4) forearm pressure
  sensing band built on flex-rigid PCBs with an ESP32-S3. KiCad sources,
  Gerbers, BOMs, and design PDFs for every revision; V4 is the current
  validated revision.
